        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="E6R6RJuI2u9ENM7obnkt-19" parent="E6R6RJuI2u9ENM7obnkt-20" style="shape=note2;boundedLbl=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=25;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" value="&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;Steps for Training:&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;1) Initialize logger (?)&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;2) Initialize environment&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;3) Setup Agent&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;4) Run training loop:&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- get environment state&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- generate step with Agent&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- update environment&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- evaluate new state&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- update Agent&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="240" x="40" y="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="E6R6RJuI2u9ENM7obnkt-21" parent="1" style="shape=note2;boundedLbl=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=25;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" value="&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;Goal here is to visualize the training progress by looking at different metrics.&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;Design a visualization strategy for different metrics groups.&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;Different types of visualization stuff:&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Optimization metrics: Multiple curves on one figure + Line plot vs. epoch/step (e.g. for Training/Validation loss, learning rate, gradient norm, gradient variance, weight norm, update norm, weight decay contribution)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Performance Metrics: Train vs. validation curves + Best-so-far indicators + Comparision between metrics (e.g. for Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1, MAE, MSE, IoU, Dice coefficient, Pixel accuracy, mAP, AP50, AP75, ...)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Resource metrics: Time series + Area plots (e.g. for GPU utilization, CPU utilization, RAM usage, VRAM usage, Training output (sample/sec, batches/sec), disk usage, network bandwith, ...)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Timing Metrics: Time series + Box plots + Histograms (e.g. for Epoch duration, Batch duration, Data loading time, Forward pass time, Backward pass time, Validation duration)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Learning Dynamics: Histograms + Heatmaps + Layer-wise plots (e.g. for Gradient norms, Activation statistics, Dead neurons, Saturated activations, Batch Norm statistics, Layer-wise learning rate, Weight distributions)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Prediction Metrics: Heatmaps, Curves, Histograms (Confusion matrix, ROC curve, Precision-recall curve, Calibation curve, Prediction histogram, Class distribution, Confidence histogram)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Dataset Metrics: Bar charts, Histograms, Pie charts, Distribution plots (e.g. for class balance, label distribution, sample weights, number of augmented samples, missing values, dataset drift, feature distributions)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Experiment Metrics: Tables, Timeline, Progress bar (Current epoch, global step, Best validation score, early stopping patience, checkpoint count, hyperparameters, random seed)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- model specific metrics (e.g. episode reward, episode length, value loss, policy loss, entropy.)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- visualization of the best runs and the worst runs using the environment&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="270" width="1290" x="410" y="540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="E6R6RJuI2u9ENM7obnkt-22" parent="1" style="shape=note2;boundedLbl=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=25;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" value="&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;Metrics that should be logged:&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Optimization Metrics (Training/Validation loss, learning rate, gradient norm, gradient variance, weight norm, update norm, weight decay contribution)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Performance Metrics (Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1, Top-k Accuracy, ROC AUC, PR AUC, MAE, MSE, RMSE, R^2, IoU, Dice coefficient, Pixel accuracy, mAP, AP50, AP75)&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Resource Metrics (GPU utilization, CPU utilization, RAM usage, VRAM usage, Training throughput (sample/sec, batches/sec), disk usage, network bandwidth)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Timing metrics (epoch duration, batch duration, data loading time, forward pass time, backward pass time, validation duration)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Learning dynamics (gradient norms, activation statistics, dead neurons, saturated activations, batch norm statistics, layer-wise learning rate, weight distributions)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Dataset metrics (class balance, label distribution, sample weights, number of augmented samples, missing values, dataset drift, feature distributions)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Experiment Metrics (current epoch, global step, best validation score, early stopping patience, checkpoint count, hyperparameters, random seed)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Model specific metrics (episode reward, episode length, value loss, policy loss, entropy)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
